208|def frozen_validation_context(pi: dict[str, Any]) -> dict[str, Any]:
209|    """Deterministic frozen context (profile requirement, oracle expectations, trace endpoint
210|    digests) derived from a PI package, for `validate.validate_bundle(..., frozen_context=...)`.
